# Build / packaging artifacts
# dist/ is where `zip` writes the upload package. It lives inside the repo so
# the artefact sits beside the source it was built from, and it is ignored so a
# stale package can never be committed and mistaken for the real one.
#
# Not to be confused with the dist/ removed in 1.1.0: that one was a checked-in
# hand-maintained copy of the source, which could and did drift. This one holds
# build output only, and holds it for exactly as long as an upload takes.
dist/
*.zip
*.crx
*.pem

